  - "\uFEFFrvc Freedoom payload modifications, 2026-10-04\n\nembeddeddoom b52f80968a25a90b2ab0cf6c97703876b2d56e59
    is modified:\nUART ASCII display/input, E1M1 baking and strip selection, Freedoom
    retail\nrules and neutral startup notices, bounded vertex/COLORMAP/translation\nserialization
    and deterministic texture-header padding.\nThe original copyright notices and
    GPL license are retained.\nCorresponding source includes the engine export, private
    patches, UART\nbackend and complete generation/build scripts.\n"
